{%- comment -%}
  dm-proof — per-page social proof content for the occasion-native landing pages.
  One place to edit review quotes: change the text here, push this file, done.
  Injects window.DAISY_PROOF = { quote, meta, line } for the current product.

  quote — the hero review shown in the proof box under the price
  meta  — attribution line under the quote
  line  — the one-liner in the stars bar above Add to Cart

  Pages without an entry get no injection; builder JS falls back to its default.
  All quotes are verbatim customer reviews harvested 4 Jul 2026 (Trustpilot /
  Feefo), lightly trimmed with ellipses only — do not invent or reword quotes.
  Gap pages (no product-specific review found yet) use the store-wide
  aggregate line "Loved by over 8,300 customers across the UK" (platform deliberately
  unnamed) until a matching review is sourced from the Etsy dashboard.
{%- endcomment -%}
